SUMMARY:[SM] San Mateo Countywide Half-Price Rain Barrel Sale: City of San
  Mateo Event (Place Order ASAP)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T120000
DTSTAMP:20261010T174029Z
UID:flowstobay-19577-1792227600-1792238400@flowstobay.org@local-events
DESCRIPTION:The annual Half-Price Rain Barrel Sale is back for its sixth y
 ear! San Mateo County residents and businesses can purchase up to two high
 -quality 50-gallon rain barrels for only $85 each (pre-tax\, regularly $15
 2)\, which is 44% below market price. Pick up your order at one of two con
 venient countywide events. \nPlus\, earn money back from the local rebate 
 program after installation to make your purchase low- or no-cost: \n\n$50 
 through the countywide rebate (for up to two barrels)\nAn additional $50 i
 f your water provider is one of 10 participating agencies\n\nDon’t wait!
  See below for rain barrel sales information: \n\nCity of San Mateo event 
 on October 17 (9am – 12pm): Sales open until October 4 at 11pm or while 
 supplies last\nCity of Half Moon Bay event on October 24 (9am – 12pm): S
 ales open until October 11 at 11pm or while supplies last\n\nSales can clo
 se sooner if we run out of stock—get yours before they’re gone! \nThe 
 address for the event will be included in your purchase order. \nLearn mor
 e\, check your rebate eligibility\, and place your order here. \nDon’t 
 miss your chance to join the rain barrel movement this year! \n\n\n\n\n\n
 \n*Orders must be picked up at the event location listed on your purchase 
 order.\n\nAges: Varies per event — many family-friendly. Confirm with ev
 ent host.\nSource: https://flowstobay.org/calendar/san-mateo-countywide-ha
 lf-price-rain-barrel-sale-city-of-san-mateo-event/\nLast synced: 2026-10-1
 0 10:40 PDT
URL:https://flowstobay.org/calendar/san-mateo-countywide-half-price-rain-b
 arrel-sale-city-of-san-mateo-event/
END:VEVENT
